    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 083 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(Dinnertime)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Dinnertime is the only time that our family can get together"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "the entire day."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Usually, my father comes home late,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "so we can’t be together at suppertime."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Because my mother worries about the health of our family,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "she prepares many different kinds of healthy side dishes."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My favorite food is bulgogi."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We always have great conversations at dinnertime."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "We mostly talk about the interesting things"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "that happened to us during the day."
    },
